","source_tag":"tformat","target":"造成 %0.2f 精神伤害，并摧毁目标的高级精神系统，降低 %d 灵巧并混乱目标（%d%% 强度），持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害、灵巧降幅和混乱强度按比例加成。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}